# Write an agent file into workspace/custom_agents and reload the roster. The file is
# rendered from these fields -- never from caller-supplied source, which would make this
# service a way to run arbitrary code. Shipped agents and ids already on the roster under
# another file are refused.
# Request
string id                 # snake_case identifier — the file is custom_agents/<id>.py
string display_name
string prompt
string[] skill_ids
bool listen               # microphone input
bool gaze                 # person-tracking gaze
---
# Response
bool success              # the file was written (the agent may still have failed to load)
string message            # the load error when it did not load, else empty
string path
string source             # the file content written
